<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-041" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-041-appraisal" source-id="s-nanqishu-041-appraisal-ws2044621">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-041-appraisal:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　史臣曰：弘毅存容，至仁表貌，汲黯剛戇，崔琰聲姿，然後能不憚雄桀，亟成譏犯。<persName id="c-nanqishu-041-appraisal:p001:m0039" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAABAC">張融</persName>標心託旨，全等塵外，吐納風雲，不論人物，而干君會友，敦義納忠，誕不越檢，常在名教。若夫奇偉之稱，則虞飜、陸績不得獨擅於前也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-041-appraisal:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　贊曰：<persName id="c-nanqishu-041-appraisal:p002:m0005" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAABAC">思光</persName>矯矯，萬里千仞。升同應諧，黜同解擯。務在連衡，不謀銷印。<persName id="c-nanqishu-041-appraisal:p002:m0035" ref="vkd_5ff_i23">彥倫</persName>辭辯，苦節清韻。白馬橫擒，雲梯獨振。</p>
</text>
